PHASE 5 — ARCHITECTURE

Goal

Design the system without implementing it.

Required

"docs/architecture.md"

Must include:

- System overview
- Component architecture
- Repository architecture
- Folder structure
- Service/module boundaries
- Responsibility mapping
- Data flow
- Database design
- API design
