PHASE 10 — AUTOMATION & AUTONOMY

Goal

Introduce execution only after intelligence, permissions, safety, and contracts are defined.

Required

- Approval flows
- Authorization checks
- Audit trails
- Revocation
- Rollback
- Failure recovery
- Rate limits
- Timeouts
- Human escalation
- Emergency shutdown

Rules

Automation must be:

- Explicitly authorized
- Logged
- Auditable
- Reversible whenever possible
- Least-privilege
- Bounded

